VALUES ('P41', 'PT-141', '10mg', 'Melanocortin Receptor Agonist · Peptide Research Compound · ≥99% purity · For laboratory research use only', 'PT-141 (10mg) is a synthetic peptide known for its ability to stimulate melanocortin receptors, which has been studied in research applications related to appetite regulation, energy homeostasis, and reproductive behavior. This peptide has been used in various research settings to investigate its effects on feeding behavior, body weight, and neuroendocrine responses.', 69, 0, 5, 0, 'data:image/jpeg;base64,', 'purity', 'storage', 'form', 'cc', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
