VALUES ('BA03', 'RECONSTITUTION SOLUTION', '3ml', 'Reconstitution Solution (Laboratory Research Use Only)', 'Reconstitution Solution (3ml) is a high-quality aqueous solution used for dissolving and reconstituting lyophilized peptides, facilitating accurate and reproducible research applications in molecular biology and biochemistry. This solution is suitable for use in a variety of research settings, including protein crystallization, peptide synthesis, and biochemical assays.', 10, 0, 5, 0, 'https://pub-37b074dc65024137894d4252794502aa.r2.dev/Product%20Vials/74-reconstitution-solution-3ml.png', 'purity', 'storage', 'form', 'cc', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
